; Shared font, 42 glyphs: DIGIT0..9, LETTER_A..Z, then DASH EXCLAM DOT COLON QUESTION SLASH.
; Code indexes FONT_DIGIT0 + d and FONT_LETTER_A + (c - 'A'): never insert or reorder tiles.
; Use from a game with "common_res": ["font"] in game.json -> #include "font.h"
;
; Design rules (bold DMG font, black on white, BGP 0xE4):
; - Cap height 7 px on rows 0-6, baseline row 6; row 7 always empty (1 px line spacing).
; - Glyphs start at column 0, max 7 px wide (cols 0-6); column 7 always empty (>= 1 px spacing).
; - Vertical stems 2 px, horizontal bars 1 px; round letters cut 1 px at each corner.
; - Digits are 6 px wide (cols 0-5, 2 px counters), so numbers read as a set apart from letters;
;   I T Y are 6 px too; punctuation sits on a 2 px column (cols 2-3).
; - Look-alikes: 0 is a narrow 6 px oval / O is 7 px wide; 1 has a flag / I has full bars;
;   5 has a square top / S is round; 8 is round on the left / B is flat; 2 is round / Z flat;
;   D has square left corners / O is round; M, N, W differ in where the diagonals meet.

@ DIGIT0
; '0'
.####...
